@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Editor" as Employee
participant ":System" as System

activate Employee

    Employee -> System : Ask to add an industry.
    activate System
    System-->Employee:Show all maps and ask to select one
    deactivate System
    Employee->System:select one map
    activate System
System-->Employee:Show the different types of industry and ask to select .


    deactivate System
    Employee->System:Select one IndustryType.



    activate System
     System-->Employee:Ask for the X,Y position.

    deactivate System

   Employee->System:Gives positionX,positionY.

   activate System
   System-->Employee:show data and ask for confirmation
deactivate System
Employee->System:Gives confirmation
activate System
   System-->Employee:Confirm the creation of this industry.

   deactivate System




@enduml
